g_s * g_g * (T_1 - T_2) = L_w * v_w

Now, we can solve for g_s:

g_s = (L_w * v_w) / (g_g * (T_1 - T_2))
g_s = (1858.5 kg/C * 1 kg) / (1.005 kg/C * (1100°C - 550°C))
g_s = 1858.5 kg/ (1.005 kg/C * 550°C)
g_s ≈ 1.8585 / 550.025
g_s ≈ 3..358

Now, we can calculate the shadowage of the grapes:
ΔS_g = g_s * g_g * (T_1 - T_2) / T_1

ΔS_g = 3.358 * 1.005 * (1100 - 550) / 1100
Δ_g = 3.358 * 1.005 * 550 / 1100
Δ_g ≈ 3.358 * 0.5025
Δ_g ≈ 1.689

