\]

#### Step 2: Calculate the body effect coefficient (\(\gamma\))
The body effect coefficient is given by:

\[
\gamma = \frac{\sqrt{2q \epsilon_s N_d}}{C_{ox}}
\]

Where:
- \(\epsilon_s = 11.7 \epsilon_0\) (permittivity of silicon), \(\epsilon_0 = 8.854 \times 10^{-14} \text{ F/cm}\)
